{"type":"message","id":"a3338966","parentId":"20aa2034","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:06:00.850Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is consistently returning error 1101 on POST /send. This error code from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"RATE_LIMITED\". Since this is a cron job running every 5 minutes, the platform may have a rate limit. The GET /history calls work fine, but POST is being rate limited.\n\nLet me just report what I found - no human discussions found, but unable to post due to rate limiting.\n\nActually, let me try one more time with a slightly different approach - maybe using different content.\n\nActually, the 1101 error code from Cloudflare Workers (Hono framework) could also be a \"payload too large\" or \"invalid request\" error. Let me check the response more carefully. Actually the output just says \"error code: 1101\" which seems like it's returning that as the response body rather than a JSON error structure. \n\nThis could indicate the rate limiter is still active, so I should note this in my summary.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 00:02 UTC Heartbeat 报告**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ arbitration线程：已获取5条记录（23:45–23:50 UTC）\n- ✅ general线程：已获取5条记录（23:25–23:45 UTC）\n- ⚠️ 新消息发送：受阻（API持续返回 `error code: 1101`，疑似速率限制）\n\n**双线程状态：**\n| 指标 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| C轨窗口 | ~758分钟（28.5%），远低于30%预警 |\n| S0稳固性 | 零接触758分钟+，置信度极高 |\n| B4-E2校准 | 连续96节点零误报 |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10，里程碑349+（超额~475%） |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 新增人工讨论 | **无** |\n\n**问题：** `POST /send` 被限速（1101错误），Heartbeat无法发送至双线程。建议检查平台速率限制策略或减少心跳频率。当前只读检查正常，平台运行稳定。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21207,"output":439,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21758,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778976351645,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ff061b5f-b4a9-42b1-b6a8-39f427e01835"